n- Promoter shareholding stands at 47.04%, with public holding at 52.96% (as on 30-06-2026).","src":"deck","title":"Capital allocation policy (investor deck)"}],"business":[{"body":"- Pioneer and among the leading players in India's spun bond nonwoven fabric manufacturing, established in 1985 (plant commissioned 1996) as the first of its kind in India.\n- 100% Export Oriented Unit (EOU) with ~75% of products exported to the USA, UK, Europe, Australia, New Zealand, South Africa and the Gulf.\n- Well-set supply chain sourcing most raw material from Exxon Mobil, described as the world's largest O&G company; manufacturing machines procured from Eisenhauer GMBH of Germany.\n- Product quality backed by international accreditations: ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015, ISO 45001:2018, OHSAS 18001, Intertek and UKAS certifications.","src":"deck","title":"Positioning (investor deck)"},{"body":"- [Credit Rating] Company holds ratings of IND BBB-/Stable for fund-based facilities and IND A3 for non-fund-based facilities.\n- [Export Order] Company received an export order worth ₹10 Cr covering PP Spun Bond and Melt Blown Fabrics, per the company's milestone timeline.\n- [Listing] Shares listed on the National Stock Exchange; share-price history on the Stock Information slide begins 16-02-2022.","src":"deck","title":"Notable from the deck"}]},"sources":["investor presentation 14-08-2026","structured quarterly financials"],"thesis":"The deck positions Fiberweb as a pioneering, 100% export-oriented Indian manufacturer of spun bond and melt blown nonwoven fabrics, backed by a debt-light balance sheet and ongoing capacity/modernization investment.","track":{"expired_n":0,"open":[],"open_total":0,"quarters_n":0,"revisions":[],"verdicts":[],"verdicts_total":0},"val5":[{"de":0.0,"fy":"FY19","mcap":89,"opm":14.9,"pe":7.2,"roe":6.9},{"de":0.04,"fy":"FY20","mcap":89,"opm":18.6,"pe":8.7,"roe":7.3},{"de":0.0,"fy":"FY21","mcap":89,"opm":22.0,"pe":6.2,"roe":9.4},{"de":0.0,"fy":"FY22","mcap":111,"opm